{"Title":"Order relative to authorizing the joint committee on Agriculture to make an investigation and study of certain current Senate documents relative to agricultural matters.","BillNumber":"S2626","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"J38","Name":"Joint Committee on Agriculture","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J38","ResponseDate":"2024-01-31T15:42:26.857"},"Cosponsors":[],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2626/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Order","Pinslip":"Senate, February 8, 2024 -- The committee on Agriculture, to whom was referred the petitions (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 43) of Anne M. Gobi for legislation relative to raw milk; and (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 502) of Anne M. Gobi and Jason M. Lewis for legislation relative to reducing food insecurity, report the accompanying Order  (Senate, No. 2626).","DocumentText":"\tOrdered, That the committee on Agriculture be authorized and directed to make an investigation and study of certain current Senate documents numbered 43 and 502 relative to agricultural matters.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Study","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J38","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J38"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Discharge to Another Committee","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J40","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J40"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}